# Other levels' raw asset archives — not used by the deployed site,
# and too large to be worth tracking here. (find-the-fox-level2-assets/
# is tracked: index.html now loads Level 2 from it.)
*.zip

# Level 3's raw sprite exports had a checkerboard baked into the pixels
# instead of real alpha (see index.html's LEVEL_3 comment) — superseded
# by level3_desert_fox_assets/clean/, which index.html actually loads.
# Kept out of git: same filenames as clean/, pure dead weight (~107MB),
# and re-using them would silently reintroduce the checkerboard bug.
level3_desert_fox_assets/level3_fennec_*.png
level3_desert_fox_assets/level3_corsac_*.png
level3_desert_fox_assets/level3_arctic_15.png
level3_desert_fox_assets/o0*.png
level3_desert_fox_assets/n0*.png
level3_desert_fox_assets/c0*.png

# Level 4's raw Tier A sprites (fox-01..15) have the same baked-in
# checkerboard problem as Level 3 — superseded by
# "find-the-fox-level4-assets (1)/clean/", which index.html actually
# loads. The Tier B/C sprites (O*/N*/C*) arrived as real transparent
# PNGs this time and are used straight from the source folder.
find-the-fox-level4-assets (1)/fox-*.png

# Local Claude Code dev-server config, not needed by the deployed site.
.claude/

# Level 5's raw Tier A exports are opaque (alpha 255 at the corners) —
# same problem as L3/L4 — superseded by level5_assets_v3_all/clean/,
# which index.html loads. _grid/ is the PM's own zone-grid reference
# crops, not runtime assets.
level5_assets_v3_all/find-the-fox-level5-v2-fox-*.png
level5_assets_v3_all/_grid/

# Level 3 v3 (re-generated) Tier B/C sprite exports are RGB with a
# baked-in checkerboard — superseded by
# find-the-fox-level3-generated-assets/clean/ (keyed + trimmed to
# content), which index.html loads. The background PNG in the same
# folder is real and stays tracked.
find-the-fox-level3-generated-assets/find-the-fox-level3-C*.png
find-the-fox-level3-generated-assets/find-the-fox-level3-N*.png
find-the-fox-level3-generated-assets/find-the-fox-level3-O*.png

# Level 8 raw Tier A/B/C exports carry a baked white/grey checkerboard
# (only the grey squares were transparent) — superseded by
# find-the-fox-level8-assets/find-the-fox-level8-assets/clean/ (keyed +
# trimmed), which index.html loads. previews/ is the vendor's contact sheets.
find-the-fox-level8-assets/find-the-fox-level8-assets/tier-a/
find-the-fox-level8-assets/find-the-fox-level8-assets/tier-b/
find-the-fox-level8-assets/find-the-fox-level8-assets/tier-c/
find-the-fox-level8-assets/find-the-fox-level8-assets/previews/

# Level 7 raw exports: Tier A foxes are opaque RGB on a grey backdrop with a
# baked checker patch, Tier B/C carry the white checker squares — superseded
# by find-the-fox-level7-assets/clean/ (keyed + trimmed), which index.html
# loads. The character reference sheet is not a runtime asset.
find-the-fox-level7-assets/fox-*.png
find-the-fox-level7-assets/character-reference-ruppells-fox.png
find-the-fox-level7-assets/tier-b/
find-the-fox-level7-assets/tier-c/

# Level 6: raw v2 exports in the folder root (grey-backdrop foxes, v2 objects,
# the old background without the family, the reference sheet) are superseded
# by find-the-fox-level6-assets/clean/ + background/ (v3 panorama), which
# index.html loads. The v3 delivery folder "(1)" holds the raw checker exports.
find-the-fox-level6-assets/fox-*.png
find-the-fox-level6-assets/O0*.png
find-the-fox-level6-assets/O1*.png
find-the-fox-level6-assets/N0*.png
find-the-fox-level6-assets/C0*.png
find-the-fox-level6-assets/background-panorama.png
find-the-fox-level6-assets/pale-fox-reference.png
find-the-fox-level6-assets (1)/

# Explorer gear bank (§2.2.1): raw gear/ exports carry the white checker +
# pockets — superseded by find-the-fox-explorer-gear/clean/, which index.html
# loads (shared across levels).
find-the-fox-explorer-gear/gear/

# Level 2 v3 pack: raw 1920x1920 exports in the folder root are superseded by
# "find-the-fox-level2-assets new/clean/" (trimmed), which index.html loads.
# The old v2 folder is no longer referenced.
find-the-fox-level2-assets new/A*.png
find-the-fox-level2-assets new/O*.png
find-the-fox-level2-assets new/N*.png
find-the-fox-level2-assets new/C*.png
find-the-fox-level2-assets/
